        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion PH-B9, Oval Rope Trim Toilet Tissue Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Oval Rope Mount Toilet Paper Holder is easy to install. The rope detailing along the edge of the mount is a classic among hardware, and for a good reason. It speaks of days gone by and the elegance of traditional design. This toilet tissue holder is available in 5 finishes, all of which are beautiful.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-rope-mount-towel-bar-fusion-tb-b9\"><b>Fusion TB-B9 Oval Rope Mount Towel Bar</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-rope-mount-towel-ring-fusion-tr-b9\"><b>Fusion TR-B9 Oval Rope Mount Towel Ring</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/oval-rope-mount-robe-hook-fusion-rh-b9\"><b>Fusion RH-B9 Oval Rope Mount Robe Hook</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Fusion Rope Rose Mounted Toilet Tissue Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Reversible to hang in either direction.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
